<title>UK: Deutsche sets call, put warrants on German Bunds.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets call, put warrants on German Bunds.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets (Deutschland) GmbH has issued American-style call and put warrants of one million per tranche on the 6.25 percent Bund due January 2024, the six percent Bund due January 2006 and the 6.5 percent Bund due July 2003.</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/DUES		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> PAYMENT DATE    06.FEB.97</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT   STRIKE   ISSUE     PREMIUM   GEARING	 MATURITY</p>
<p>6.25 PCT JAN.24 BUND</p>
<p> CALL A    98.0     1.34 DEM  4.51 PCT  70.93 TIMES   17.DEC.97</p>
<p> CALL B    100.0    1.03 DEM  6.29 PCT  92.28 TIMES   11.MAR.98</p>
<p>6.0 PCT JAN.06 BUND</p>
<p> CALL A    105.0    0.51 DEM  3.58 PCT 199.72 TIMES   12.MAR.98</p>
<p> CALL B    102.0    1.28 DEM  1.39 PCT  79.57 TIMES   12.MAR.98</p>
<p>  PUT C     98.0    2.01 DEM  5.76 PCT  50.68 TIMES   12.MAR.98</p>
<p>6.5 PCT JUL.03 BUND</p>
<p> CALL A    109.0    0.55 DEM  2.45 PCT 194.42 TIMES   11.MAR.98</p>
<p> CALL B    107.0    1.14 DEM  1.13 PCT  93.80 TIMES   11.MAR.98</p>
<p>  PUT C    104.0    2.15 DEM  4.75 PCT  49.73 TIMES   11.MAR.98</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
